     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "If the original repository is configured as localhost, the exported objects will not be useful to repositories running on other machines.  You can configure an actual hostname for your repository in either the fedora.fcfg file (for pre-3.6 installations) or the WEB-INF/applicationContext.xml file (in 3.6 installations).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
