  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Running the following command to ingest a file to a Fedora repo:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "./fedora-ingest.sh f ~/authors_migration/h_c_andersen/sifd_1058.xml info:fedora/fedora-system:FOXML-1.1 server_url:port_number fedoraAdmin password http",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "returns the following message:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Error  :  Caused by: [DefaultExternalContentManager] returned an error.  The underlying error was a org.fcrepo.server.errors.GeneralException  The message was  \"Error getting ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/get/sifd:1058/provenanceMetadata/2013-07-17T08:29:40.294Z"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/get/sifd:1058/provenanceMetadata/2013-07-17T08:29:40.294Z",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"  .  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Last attempted file was /home/jatr/authors_migration/h_c_andersen/sifd_1058.xml)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have attached an excerpt from the fedora.log from the server and the FOXML I was trying to ingest ",
       "type": "text"
      }
